# Keep shell scripts, the Caddyfile, Docker Compose and Python LF-only.
# They are used from Linux containers (Caddy) and from bash, where CRLF breaks
# shebangs and Caddyfile parsing. PowerShell and Markdown are fine either way.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
